docs/

# Local-only, same rule as docs/ above: no backup anywhere, exists on one
# machine, never `rm`. A fresh clone will not carry these — absent, not
# deleted. Both were tracked until this commit; untracking stops future
# commits and does not rewrite past ones.
CLAUDE.md
backlog_ideas/

